      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Trivial Physical Mutation, Tolerable</strong></p><p>One of your sensory organs grows 50% in size, giving you the @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.9h82z72XGo9tfgQS]{Acute Sense} Talent with the relevant specialisation. Reduce your Fellowship by -5.</p><p></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p>1d100</p></td><td><p>Organ</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>01-25</p></td><td><p>Eyes (1d10: 1-5 One, 6-10: Both)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>26-50</p></td><td><p>Ears (1d10: 1-5 One, 6-10: Both)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>51-75</p></td><td><p>Nose</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>76-100</p></td><td><p>Mouth</p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
